---
import PhotoSlot from './PhotoSlot.astro';
---

<section class="bg-base-200">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-5 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <PhotoSlot alt="Bill on the dock" caption="Bill, on the dock" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm -rotate-2" />
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold md:text-5xl">
        The jobs too small for a vendor, and too tedious for your Saturday.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/80">
        I take on the tasks owners don't care to do, don't have time for, or that are too minor for vendors to bother
        with. The goal is simple: your boat is always ready to take wherever the next adventure might be.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/80">
        For larger jobs, I bring in the best of the local vendors in Santa Barbara and Ventura.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
